{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"还说不清\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里有股劲催着自己别停，却说不清自己在等什么、为何不安，念头还没跟上身体的反应。\",\n      \"key\": \"催着自己别停\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他想保住自尊，可真投进去又怕会失去别的东西，心里也想停下来喘口气。\",\n      \"key\": \"保住自尊\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他忽然觉得熟悉，便本能地想往前，身体仿佛还记得怎么走，却回不到从前。\",\n      \"key\": \"本能地想往前\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他想找个让自己敢走的理由，可每回快要说服自己，舍不得又冒出来，他又为非得想清才肯走而难堪。\",\n      \"key\": \"非得想清\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R1\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留无名的推动力与不知所等，补入念头跟不上身体反应的过程，解释失落无从命名和意识尚未安顿的状态。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R2\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不愿停下与怕投入后失去的冲突，借保住自尊解释他为何强撑；删去不行动就等于认可现状的无依据判断。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"补入\",\n      \"why\": \"补上v6遗漏的段内变化：熟悉的感受唤起本能的向前冲动，身体仿佛先知道如何迈步，但这并不能让他回到从前。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R3\", \"R4\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"将寻找理由与反复被不舍拉回合为一个循环，保留他的难堪和非得想清才肯走的执念，为S02不再以没想清为由继续等待作铺垫；删去确信变陌生的抽象表述和替他发问的句式。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "40c535f5-e8f4-42c9-92f5-995575782bf8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T055209989024Z", "elapsed_seconds": 323.11, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T05:57:33.106716+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e4164881076cb891a167a0e36672cdb22334c33bf49c1d6c8f92ab6defce1105", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T055209989024Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "c5fada4b78040124e8e65ea26b37de1f5fa446844e449ef9e1d2cf7dd6064ca9"}}}
